      "literal_gloss": "as a twinkling",
      "translations": {
        "saheeh": "And to Allah belongs the unseen [aspects] of the heavens and the earth. And the command for the Hour is not but as a glance of the eye or even nearer. Indeed, Allah is over all things competent.",
